    "sections": {
        "description": "The Import Export Company theme is built for businesses that want to create a powerful online presence and confidently showcase global trade services, making it ideal for international trading firms, import export companies, export agencies, logistics providers, customs clearance offices, freight forwarding businesses, overseas shipping companies, import brokers, and global trading startups. With a clean, modern, and highly functional layout, the theme helps highlight import export services, product catalogs, supply chain solutions, international sourcing, trade consultancy, global partnerships, certifications, transport solutions, and worldwide market reach in a professional and informative format. It includes flexible customization options that allow easy control over colors, typography, and page layouts without technical expertise, along with dedicated sections for international trade services, export documentation support, customs brokerage, freight forwarding solutions, cargo handling, and global shipment tracking. Its SEO-friendly structure improves visibility for searches related to global trading, import export consultancy, export management services, and international logistics, while speed optimization and responsive design ensure smooth performance across desktops, tablets, and smartphones. With clear navigation, strong visual sections, and well-organized service blocks, this theme enables import export businesses to build credibility, connect with overseas buyers and partners, showcase trade compliance and shipping updates, and expand their digital reach across multiple global markets with ease."
    },
